						<span xml:lang="en">The Local Authorities (Executive and Alternative Arrangements) (Modification of Enactments and Other Provisions) (Wales) Order 2002</span> / <span xml:lang="cy">Gorchymyn Awdurdodau Lleol (Trefniadau Gweithredol a Threfniadau Amgen) (Addasu Deddfiadau a Darpariaethau Eraill) (Cymru) 2002</span>
